<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-24T14:02:19.642Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:02:19 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Iraqi prime minister has ordered the ministry to take direct control of oilfields in areas held by Kurdish parties, prompting the KDP and PUK to unite in opposition and warn Baghdad against unilateral decisions. Security forces have dismissed the border crossings chief and fired a border official, while new commanders have taken over Kirkuk operations and preparations are underway for a military withdrawal from certain cities. The government is also intensifying an anti-smuggling drive that targets Kurdish border crossings and oil theft, which has been reported across all governorates. 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQT0ttY1ZZa0d3ajhmMUVZYmhrdHNGd0E4aC0wQWswZzc0UkFrcndsZ3pJUkJQMVF3Rlp0cjdGdkc2bG5XY093OWx6QWdtQVlJMVpRN2QzUUZicGRBZEROT2JUZEdQUTRpWHBpYzNXMVVwN1FQbmZpVmZfTm1leHQzclpZSkdsRk9MWHBzZEpaSlFoVjd0QzZQMnl2SDladHhlTzFmYkhmT2xPSlRTc2o2VmY2ZThoQ0dxbl94NXAxaXFWTHBNb1V6bzhXRTFPQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisisgroup.org/qna/asia-pacific/myanmar/world-court-finds-myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiREFVX3lxTFBhUXYwSGd5UzJvcVdqN2pycURhZ1pVSTNnSkQ5Umd0UjRYcWFFdnpSMGtXM3lhdDhnM0VmVHRhZ2V0NTdH?oc=5&quot;&gt;964media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPa2Q0WGRESUtsWUxYRktHM2xISDlpWHJaZWZpeWlDQVFrMmUwMTVuRTFGS1ZXNW1oWlh0bFdHQURGd29xc3BzOTF1MTJoaE9qcnM5VFBibjUyZjJWNGtqMzNQVmJFN0JKbi00STMwd0JCQjhnd0JVYkNJdGF5aGFtREN6ZUhQUTV0NUpBTHNIdnhTSHNYUmVZR3NkUXNQZHhxZVd0TU9tNkp6WE9tVVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Quantum Commodity Intelligence&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNU1llYi13WVdnd3pESjFmU1R5SVo5UWZT